  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The plane which bisects the line segment joining the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> at right angles, passes through which one of the following points?",
